{"id": "uUMPULuwdLI", "title": "How to Order Food at a Restaurant in English", "channel": "Learn English with Bob the Canadian", "duration": 451, "auto": false, "lines": [{"i": 0, "s": 0.26, "e": 1.77, "en": "Hi, Bob, the Canadian here.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 1, "s": 1.77, "e": 6.27, "en": "In this English lesson, I'm going to take you to four different restaurants, and I'm", "ko": ""}, {"i": 2, "s": 6.27, "e": 12.45, "en": "going to teach you four different English phrases that you can use to order food in", "ko": ""}, {"i": 3, "s": 12.45, "e": 14.56, "en": "English.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 4, "s": 18.24, "e": 23.64, "en": "Well, hey, welcome to this video on ordering food in English at a restaurant.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 5, "s": 23.64, "e": 27.07, "en": "Before we get started though, I wanted to mention two things.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 6, "s": 27.07, "e": 31.78, "en": "Number one, if you haven't yet subscribed to my channel, please click that red subscribe", "ko": ""}, {"i": 7, "s": 31.78, "e": 32.78, "en": "button below.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 8, "s": 32.78, "e": 37.5, "en": "And number two, if you're worried that I'm going to eat all this food myself,", "ko": ""}, {"i": 9, "s": 37.5, "e": 38.44, "en": "I'm not.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 10, "s": 38.44, "e": 44.64, "en": "My kids are eagerly waiting at home to see what food I order and what food I bring", "ko": ""}, {"i": 11, "s": 44.65, "e": 45.65, "en": "home today.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 12, "s": 45.65, "e": 49.3, "en": "So, the first thing we're going to order is a pizza.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 13, "s": 49.3, "e": 54.0, "en": "In this restaurant, I'm going to order a small pepperoni pizza, and I'm going to use the", "ko": ""}, {"i": 14, "s": 54.0, "e": 57.61, "en": "phrase \"I would like to order.\"", "ko": ""}, {"i": 15, "s": 57.61, "e": 59.83, "en": "Or the short form of it would be, \"I'd like to order.\"", "ko": ""}, {"i": 16, "s": 59.83, "e": 63.54, "en": "So, let's go in and order a small pepperoni pizza.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 17, "s": 65.06, "e": 66.28, "en": "Hi, how can I help you?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 18, "s": 66.29, "e": 68.68, "en": "Yes, I would like to order a small pepperoni pizza.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 19, "s": 68.68, "e": 70.52, "en": "Is it for pickup?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 20, "s": 70.52, "e": 71.8, "en": "Yes. For pickup, please.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 21, "s": 72.0, "e": 72.82, "en": "Yep.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 22, "s": 73.08, "e": 74.52, "en": "What's your phone number?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 23, "s": 74.52, "e": 78.9, "en": "It's 905 386-0042.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 24, "s": 79.46, "e": 81.82, "en": "And your name? Bob. Bob. Yep.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 25, "s": 82.12, "e": 84.14, "en": "What would you like to order, Bob?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 26, "s": 84.14, "e": 88.44, "en": "Just a small pepperoni pizza.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 27, "s": 88.6, "e": 90.3, "en": "And that's everything for today?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 28, "s": 90.36, "e": 92.42, "en": "That's everything for today, yup.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 29, "s": 92.58, "e": 95.96, "en": "So your total comes to $9.05.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 30, "s": 96.18, "e": 97.18, "en": "Cash?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 31, "s": 97.38, "e": 98.38, "en": "Yep.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 32, "s": 103.38, "e": 105.46, "en": ".95 cents is your change.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 33, "s": 105.47, "e": 106.47, "en": "Thank you.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 34, "s": 106.47, "e": 108.66, "en": "And it will take about 15 to 20 minutes.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 35, "s": 108.66, "e": 111.92, "en": "15 to 20 minutes. Okay. Thank you very much.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 36, "s": 113.18, "e": 118.23, "en": "So, the next thing I thought we should order is a hamburger and some fries.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 37, "s": 118.23, "e": 123.44, "en": "It's a pretty classic thing to order from a fast food restaurant.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 38, "s": 123.44, "e": 129.52, "en": "And in this restaurant I will be using, the phrase \"I will have\" or \"I'll have.\"", "ko": ""}, {"i": 39, "s": 129.52, "e": 131.66, "en": "I'll have is the short form of it.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 40, "s": 131.66, "e": 135.36, "en": "So, let's go in and get a burger and some fries.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 41, "s": 136.66, "e": 138.88, "en": "Hi, how are you?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 42, "s": 139.0, "e": 140.04, "en": "Good, sir. How are you?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 43, "s": 140.04, "e": 141.04, "en": "Good.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 44, "s": 141.04, "e": 142.6, "en": "I'll have the Teen Burger.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 45, "s": 142.6, "e": 144.4, "en": "It's for here or to go, sir?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 46, "s": 144.66, "e": 146.54, "en": "To go, please.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 47, "s": 146.82, "e": 148.36, "en": "And the combo, please.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 48, "s": 148.62, "e": 149.98, "en": "Fries and a root beer?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 49, "s": 149.98, "e": 152.94, "en": "Fries and root beer would be good, yup.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 50, "s": 152.94, "e": 154.2, "en": "That's everything? That's everything.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 51, "s": 154.2, "e": 157.62, "en": "And can I have a name for the order? Bob. Bob.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 52, "s": 157.74, "e": 159.56, "en": "It's $11.96, sir.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 53, "s": 159.56, "e": 161.46, "en": "Thank you.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 54, "s": 165.44, "e": 167.06, "en": "Thank you very much, sir.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 55, "s": 167.06, "e": 170.8, "en": "Thank you very much.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 56, "s": 173.64, "e": 175.5, "en": "Here you go sir. The straws are over there.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 57, "s": 178.2, "e": 180.88, "en": "Have a good day.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 58, "s": 180.89, "e": 182.23, "en": "Thank you very much. See you.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 59, "s": 182.23, "e": 184.92, "en": "Well, we're done here.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 60, "s": 184.92, "e": 187.11, "en": "We got a burger and some fries.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 61, "s": 187.11, "e": 190.56, "en": "And the drink I got is a root beer.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 62, "s": 190.56, "e": 192.57, "en": "So, let's head to the next place.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 63, "s": 192.57, "e": 196.7, "en": "So, the next thing I thought we should order is a sub.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 64, "s": 196.7, "e": 197.7, "en": "In this restaurant.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 65, "s": 197.7, "e": 202.18, "en": "I'll use the phrase, \"Could I have\" to order my sub.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 66, "s": 202.18, "e": 203.78, "en": "I'm not sure what sub I'm getting yet.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 67, "s": 203.78, "e": 207.62, "en": "We'll see when we get in there.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 68, "s": 207.62, "e": 209.19, "en": "Alright, what would you like?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 69, "s": 209.19, "e": 212.4, "en": "Could I have a cold cut combo?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 70, "s": 212.41, "e": 213.41, "en": "Sure.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 71, "s": 213.41, "e": 214.41, "en": "Which bread?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 72, "s": 214.41, "e": 215.41, "en": "Whole wheat bread.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 73, "s": 215.41, "e": 216.41, "en": "Foot long?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 74, "s": 216.41, "e": 217.49, "en": "A foot long, please, yes.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 75, "s": 217.49, "e": 219.09, "en": "Thank you.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 76, "s": 219.09, "e": 220.47, "en": "Toasted?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 77, "s": 220.47, "e": 222.68, "en": "Not toasted.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 78, "s": 222.68, "e": 225.9, "en": "White cheddar, orange or swiss?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 79, "s": 225.9, "e": 228.06, "en": "Orange cheddar, please.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 80, "s": 228.06, "e": 229.5, "en": "What would you like on that?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 81, "s": 229.5, "e": 237.06, "en": "Some tomatoes, some spinach, and some cucumbers, please.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 82, "s": 237.07, "e": 239.04, "en": "Is there anything else?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 83, "s": 239.04, "e": 240.68, "en": "Yeah, is there a combo?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 84, "s": 240.68, "e": 241.68, "en": "Yes.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 85, "s": 241.68, "e": 242.92, "en": "Yeah. Could we make that a combo?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 86, "s": 243.26, "e": 245.5, "en": "Would you like cookies or chips?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 87, "s": 245.5, "e": 247.6, "en": "Cookies, please.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 88, "s": 247.61, "e": 248.61, "en": "Alrighty.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 89, "s": 248.61, "e": 249.61, "en": "You get two, which...", "ko": ""}, {"i": 90, "s": 249.61, "e": 252.76, "en": "Two chocolate chip.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 91, "s": 252.76, "e": 254.7, "en": "Do you want a fountain drink or a bottle today?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 92, "s": 254.7, "e": 256.3, "en": "Fountain drink.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 93, "s": 256.3, "e": 257.3, "en": "Medium size?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 94, "s": 257.32, "e": 258.32, "en": "Yes.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 95, "s": 260.1, "e": 262.56, "en": "That'll be $12.05. From $15?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 96, "s": 271.5, "e": 272.42, "en": "$2.95.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 97, "s": 272.42, "e": 273.4, "en": "Thank you very much.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 98, "s": 273.4, "e": 274.6, "en": "Would you like a receipt today?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 99, "s": 274.6, "e": 275.46, "en": "No receipt, no.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 100, "s": 275.46, "e": 276.3, "en": "Thank you.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 101, "s": 276.3, "e": 277.28, "en": "You're welcome.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 102, "s": 277.28, "e": 278.36, "en": "So, I got my sub.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 103, "s": 278.36, "e": 280.3, "en": "Now I just need to fill up my own drink over here.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 104, "s": 285.34, "e": 287.76, "en": "So, I'm here at Tim Hortons, of course.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 105, "s": 287.77, "e": 292.74, "en": "The last thing I'm going to order today is a half dozen donuts.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 106, "s": 292.74, "e": 297.07, "en": "So, my kids will have something to eat for dessert.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 107, "s": 297.07, "e": 301.68, "en": "I'm going to use the phrase, \"Could I get\" to order the food that I need.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 108, "s": 301.68, "e": 304.44, "en": "Hi, could I get six donuts?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 109, "s": 305.8, "e": 307.7, "en": "Do you need to know what kind?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 110, "s": 307.88, "e": 309.96, "en": "You can just choose them, if you want, like after you pay.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 111, "s": 310.04, "e": 311.04, "en": "Yep, so that sounds good.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 112, "s": 311.05, "e": 312.05, "en": "That's it.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 113, "s": 312.05, "e": 313.05, "en": "That's it?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 114, "s": 313.05, "e": 314.05, "en": "Yep.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 115, "s": 314.05, "e": 315.05, "en": "Do you have a rewards card today?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 116, "s": 315.05, "e": 316.05, "en": "Nope.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 117, "s": 316.05, "e": 317.05, "en": "And is that cash or debit.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 118, "s": 317.05, "e": 318.04, "en": "Debit.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 119, "s": 323.16, "e": 327.16, "en": "I have to let them know which donuts I want.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 120, "s": 328.84, "e": 332.8, "en": "So, I'll have a chocolate dip.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 121, "s": 332.8, "e": 335.8, "en": "There's one right here, I think.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 122, "s": 335.8, "e": 349.34, "en": "Boston cream, vanilla dip, a maple dip, a classic sour cream, and another Boston cream.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 123, "s": 350.64, "e": 352.52, "en": "Here you go. Awesome. Thank you. Have a good day.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 124, "s": 352.54, "e": 356.9, "en": "I think of all the stuff I bought today, this is going to be my kids' favorite, for", "ko": ""}, {"i": 125, "s": 356.9, "e": 357.9, "en": "sure.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 126, "s": 357.9, "e": 361.56, "en": "So, I actually almost forgot that I have to pick up the pizza yet.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 127, "s": 361.56, "e": 367.49, "en": "So, we're back at the pizza shop, and I'm going to go in and get my small pepperoni", "ko": ""}, {"i": 128, "s": 367.49, "e": 368.49, "en": "pizza.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 129, "s": 368.49, "e": 370.65, "en": "Hi, small pizza for Bob.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 130, "s": 370.65, "e": 371.76, "en": "Yep, it's ready.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 131, "s": 371.76, "e": 375.64, "en": "Excellent.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 132, "s": 375.64, "e": 376.64, "en": "Thank you very much.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 133, "s": 376.64, "e": 380.86, "en": "So, I got the pizza and our little trip is almost done.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 134, "s": 380.86, "e": 383.11, "en": "But there's one more stop, actually.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 135, "s": 383.11, "e": 387.75, "en": "So, I was almost done making the video, and Jen texted me and asked if I could get her", "ko": ""}, {"i": 136, "s": 387.75, "e": 389.38, "en": "a peppermint tea from Tim Hortons.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 137, "s": 389.38, "e": 394.24, "en": "Hi, Hortons, may I help you? Yeah. Could I get a large peppermint tea?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 138, "s": 395.1, "e": 396.4, "en": "Anything else? Nope.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 139, "s": 396.4, "e": 397.18, "en": "That's everything.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 140, "s": 397.18, "e": 398.44, "en": "All right. $2.00, come on up.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 141, "s": 398.58, "e": 401.46, "en": "Thank you. You're welcome.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 142, "s": 403.0, "e": 405.62, "en": "Peppermint tea, black?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 143, "s": 405.62, "e": 406.28, "en": "Is it a $1?", "ko": ""}, {"i": 144, "s": 406.4, "e": 409.48, "en": "It's $2.02, so $2.00. $2.02.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 145, "s": 410.22, "e": 411.84, "en": "There you go. Do you have a rewards card? No.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 146, "s": 411.84, "e": 413.12, "en": "That's all right. Here you go.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 147, "s": 413.44, "e": 414.78, "en": "Thank you. Have a good day. You, too.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 148, "s": 414.78, "e": 418.74, "en": "One really big cup of peppermint tea for Jen.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 149, "s": 418.74, "e": 420.99, "en": "And now I think I'm done.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 150, "s": 420.99, "e": 424.9, "en": "Well, hey, that was four ways to order food in English.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 151, "s": 424.9, "e": 428.49, "en": "I hope that you learned a few new English phrases today.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 152, "s": 428.49, "e": 429.81, "en": "Bob the Canadian, here.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 153, "s": 429.81, "e": 431.93, "en": "You are learning English with Bob the Canadian.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 154, "s": 431.93, "e": 435.46, "en": "If you're new here, don't forget to click that red subscribe button below, and give", "ko": ""}, {"i": 155, "s": 435.46, "e": 440.24, "en": "me a thumbs up if this video helped you learn just a little bit more English.", "ko": ""}, {"i": 156, "s": 440.24, "e": 443.81, "en": "And while you're here, why don't you stay and watch a couple more videos.", "ko": ""}]}